Hi,

Thank you for contacting Clearit.

We only offer our bond services to Importers who we process the customs
clearance. If you are looking for a stand alone bond only and no clearance,
unfortunately, we wouldn't be able to assist and we recommend contacting a
local broker at the U.S. port of entry. Please see the link below for a
list of brokers by port:

https://www.cbp.gov/about/contact/brokers-listing

If you have any further questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate
to let us know.

Thanks,



